# Seebra keeps this board's state as text: one pretty-printed JSON file per
# entity, keys sorted, one reference per line. Git delta-compresses text and
# diffs and merges it line by line; keep it that way.
* text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf diff
# No merge driver is set: git's line merge works because a change to a step
# touches its own file. A conflict in a dashboard's list of idents is resolved
# by keeping both lines. Never use merge=union on JSON: it can drop a comma.
